&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Who we are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform is a refreshingly different form builder. We help over 150,000 businesses collect the data they need with forms, surveys, and quizzes that people enjoy. Designed to look striking and feel effortless to fill out, Typeform drives 500 million responses every year—and integrates with essential tools like Slack, Zapier, and Hubspot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Typeform is fully remote by design. For this role, we can hire candidates based in the UK, Ireland, Germany, Portugal, Spain or The Netherlands&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior FP&amp;amp;A Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Finance team and help drive clarity through data. This is a &lt;strong&gt;hands-on, individual contributor role&lt;/strong&gt; with a strong focus on analysis and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional finance business partner or governance role. Instead, you’ll spend most of your time working directly with data, building models, analyzing performance, and translating complex signals into clear, actionable insights for Product, Growth, and Go-to-Market teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll thrive in this role if you enjoy digging deep into numbers, understand SaaS and product-led growth dynamics, and are comfortable owning analyses from start to finish.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain, and improve financial and operational models to support forecasting, planning, and performance tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze key &lt;strong&gt;SaaS and PLG metrics&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g. ARR, expansion, churn, CAC, LTV, conversion funnels) and connect them to business drivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Growth, and Go-to-Market teams to understand performance and surface insights — without acting as a traditional finance gatekeeper&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex data into &lt;strong&gt;clear narratives and recommendations&lt;/strong&gt; that inform decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own recurring analyses, dashboards, and reporting with a strong focus on accuracy, usability, and speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support budgeting and forecasting cycles with detailed, bottoms-up analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve how we use data, tools, and processes to understand the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in FP&amp;amp;A or a similar hands-on analytical role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience working with &lt;strong&gt;SaaS businesses&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally in a product-led growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of comfort working directly with raw data, models, and analytical tools (e.g. spreadsheets, BI tools, SQL — depending on your stack)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to translate analysis into &lt;strong&gt;practical, actionable insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with Marketing, Growth, or Commercial teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An execution-first mindset: you enjoy owning problems end-to-end and getting things done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating as an &lt;strong&gt;experienced individual contributor&lt;/strong&gt;, without people management responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, adaptable, and able to navigate ambiguity in a fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Typeform drives hundreds of millions of interactions each year, enabling conversational, human-centered experiences across the globe. We &lt;strong&gt;move as one team&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering our collective efforts by valuing each individual’s unique perspective. This fosters &lt;strong&gt;strong bonds&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in respect, transparency, and trust. We &lt;strong&gt;champion our diverse customer base&lt;/strong&gt; by anticipating their needs and addressing their challenges with priority. Committed to excellence, we&lt;strong&gt; hold high expectations &lt;/strong&gt;for ourselves and each other, continuously striving to deliver exceptional results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and stand firmly against discrimination and harassment of any kind—whether based on race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or expression, or veteran status. Everyone is welcome here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Who we are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform is a refreshingly different form builder. We help over 150,000 businesses collect the data they need with forms, surveys, and quizzes that people enjoy. Designed to look striking and feel effortless to fill out, Typeform drives 500 million responses every year—and integrates with essential tools like Slack, Zapier, and Hubspot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2099&quot; data-end=&quot;2233&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2119&quot; data-end=&quot;2149&quot;&gt;Freelance Principal Recruiter&lt;/strong&gt; to join Typeform on an initial, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2172&quot; data-end=&quot;2232&quot;&gt;full-time engagement&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;In this role, you’ll operate as a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2269&quot; data-end=&quot;2310&quot;&gt;full-cycle Talent Acquisition Partner&lt;/strong&gt;, owning hiring end-to-end across a mix of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2353&quot; data-end=&quot;2385&quot;&gt;technical and business roles&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;You’ll work in a small, high-ownership TA team, where the focus is not just on delivery—but on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2483&quot; data-end=&quot;2544&quot;&gt;consistently raising the bar on talent and hiring quality&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Things you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ggdbeu&quot; data-start=&quot;2571&quot; data-end=&quot;2665&quot;&gt;Own and drive &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2587&quot; data-end=&quot;2623&quot;&gt;8–12 active roles simultaneously&lt;/strong&gt; across both technical, commercial and business functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7y4bcy&quot; data-start=&quot;2666&quot; data-end=&quot;2773&quot;&gt;Build and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2687&quot; data-end=&quot;2723&quot;&gt;high-quality candidate pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;, with a strong focus on sourcing passive talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;cfohpj&quot; data-start=&quot;2774&quot; data-end=&quot;2878&quot;&gt;Partner closely with hiring managers to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2816&quot; data-end=&quot;2876&quot;&gt;define role scope, success criteria, and hiring strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ll8d7j&quot; data-start=&quot;2879&quot; data-end=&quot;2994&quot;&gt;Run structured hiring processes from intake through to offer, ensuring &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2952&quot; data-end=&quot;2992&quot;&gt;clarity and alignment at every stage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kv9lve&quot; data-start=&quot;2995&quot; data-end=&quot;3096&quot;&gt;Drive &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3003&quot; data-end=&quot;3030&quot;&gt;proactive communication&lt;/strong&gt; with stakeholders, anticipating needs and keeping momentum high&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16yg60k&quot; data-start=&quot;3097&quot; data-end=&quot;3193&quot;&gt;Deliver a strong candidate experience while maintaining a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3157&quot; data-end=&quot;3191&quot;&gt;high and consistent hiring bar&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ooze9z&quot; data-start=&quot;3194&quot; data-end=&quot;3262&quot;&gt;Close candidates by building trust, alignment, and long-term fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you already bring to the table:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;autbs&quot; data-start=&quot;3296&quot; data-end=&quot;3379&quot;&gt;Proven experience as a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3321&quot; data-end=&quot;3377&quot;&gt;full-cycle recruiter in a global SaaS or technology company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1byoaiw&quot; data-start=&quot;3380&quot; data-end=&quot;3447&quot;&gt;Comfortable hiring across both &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3413&quot; data-end=&quot;3445&quot;&gt;technical and business roles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;grnn3c&quot; data-start=&quot;3448&quot; data-end=&quot;3547&quot;&gt;Strong sourcing capability—you know how to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3493&quot; data-end=&quot;3545&quot;&gt;identify, engage, and convert passive candidates&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jjeudl&quot; data-start=&quot;3548&quot; data-end=&quot;3636&quot;&gt;Confidence in assessing talent and contributing to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3601&quot; data-end=&quot;3634&quot;&gt;high-quality hiring decisions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qnslg1&quot; data-start=&quot;3637&quot; data-end=&quot;3717&quot;&gt;Strong stakeholder management—you bring &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3679&quot; data-end=&quot;3715&quot;&gt;structure, clarity, and momentum&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tce487&quot; data-start=&quot;3718&quot; data-end=&quot;3805&quot;&gt;High ownership and autonomy—you’re comfortable operating at speed with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3782&quot; data-end=&quot;3803&quot;&gt;limited direction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mo9tzs&quot; data-start=&quot;3806&quot; data-end=&quot;3883&quot;&gt;Ability to thrive in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3829&quot; data-end=&quot;3881&quot;&gt;fast-moving and sometimes ambiguous environments&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Typeform drives hundreds of millions of interactions each year, enabling conversational, human-centered experiences across the globe. We &lt;strong&gt;move as one team&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering our collective efforts by valuing each individual’s unique perspective. This fosters &lt;strong&gt;strong bonds&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in respect, transparency, and trust. We &lt;strong&gt;champion our diverse customer base&lt;/strong&gt; by anticipating their needs and addressing their challenges with priority. Committed to excellence, we&lt;strong&gt; hold high expectations &lt;/strong&gt;for ourselves and each other, continuously striving to deliver exceptional results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and stand firmly against discrimination and harassment of any kind—whether based on race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or expression, or veteran status. Everyone is welcome here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Analyst to help our product teams make better decisions by bringing quantitative evidence into discovery, prioritisation, experimentation and delivery. Sitting within our Product &amp;amp; Tech organisation, you&#39;ll work closely with Product Managers, Designers, Researchers and Engineers to ensure decisions are grounded in evidence. You’ll connect behavioural product data with qualitative research and commercial insight to help teams identify opportunities, understand customer behaviour and measure whether our products are creating the intended outcomes. This is a hands-on product analytics role focused on understanding customer behaviour and turning quantitative evidence into actionable product insight. You will also connect product analytics with relevant commercial and operational data where this helps teams understand the wider impact of their decisions. Our team is a bunch of lovely, smart, and dedicated humans. And we offer some great benefits too!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the analytics partner across our cross-functional product teams, using data and insights to shape product strategy and drive measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping teams turn strategic goals, customer problems and product hypotheses into clear questions, measurable outcomes and meaningful success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysing customer journeys, funnels, conversion, activation, feature adoption, engagement, retention and customer segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using product and business data to identify behavioural patterns, friction points and opportunities for improvement or growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting prioritisation by establishing baselines, sizing opportunities and explaining the potential customer and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using Amplitude to explore customer behaviour, create cohorts and build clear, reusable dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving how Awin uses Amplitude through consistent metric definitions, event taxonomies, dashboard templates and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with Product and Engineering to define tracking requirements, address implementation gaps and ensure data is captured accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping teams design and evaluate product experiments by defining hypotheses, primary and guardrail metrics and suitable methods for interpreting results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating clear dashboards and visualisations that help teams understand product performance and connect customer behaviour with relevant commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combining quantitative analysis with UX Research and customer feedback to understand both what customers are doing and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicating findings clearly through concise narratives, visualisations and practical recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping product teams become more confident and independent in their use of data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as a trusted analytical partner to Product leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving best practices for product measurement and experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in product analytics or a product-focused data role, working directly with digital product teams and understand how Product, Design, Research and Engineering collaborate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong track record of using behavioural product data to uncover insights, tell a clear story and influence product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can move beyond reporting what happened to explain why it matters and what a team should consider doing next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in SQL and comfortable exploring large or complex datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience with a product analytics platform such as Amplitude, Mixpanel, Heap or an equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience supporting product experiments and A/B tests, including defining hypotheses and success metrics and interpreting results appropriately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand product instrumentation, including event taxonomies, tracking plans and metric definitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have some experience defining product KPIs, measurement frameworks and appropriate success and guardrail metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can translate ambiguous product or business problems into focused analytical questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate complex findings clearly to technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable working across different product areas and balancing deeper analysis with faster questions that help teams maintain momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Amplitude preferred but not necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;RichTextList-bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-Week&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritise your mental health and wellbeing by offering you a four-day Flexi-Week (with one lighter or completely disconnected day per week) at full pay, with no reduction to your annual holiday allowance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-Office&lt;/strong&gt;: We offer an international culture and flexibility through our hybrid working model, designed to foster collaboration, trust, and autonomy.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Expense Contribution &amp;amp; Remote Working Furniture&lt;/strong&gt;: You will receive a monthly allowance to cover part of your running costs, as well as a furniture package to support you in setting up a comfortable workspace at home.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private Medical Insurance&lt;/strong&gt;: Comprehensive coverage for a range of health, vision and dental treatments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meal Vouchers&lt;/strong&gt;: Daily support for your lunch expenses.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Screen Working Glasses&lt;/strong&gt;: We offer a subsidy towards the cost of glasses required for screen work.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In addition, you’ll benefit from our global offering, including health and wellbeing initiatives, learning and development via Awin Academy, and peer-to-peer recognition programmes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 2000, Awin is proud of our dynamic, social and inclusive culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Like all businesses, we’ve had to adapt and nurture our culture in a virtual environment. Our virtual ‘Life @ Awin’ hub brings our colleagues from across the globe together for various social activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion are paramount to us, and we proudly pursue and hire diverse team members. We champion uniqueness and authenticity; this is who we are at our core. Our network of affiliate partnerships are diverse and transparent, as are the employees powering our vision to build the world’s leading open partner ecosystem. We welcome all backgrounds, identities, and experiences. If you need support at any point in the application or interview process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
